would like people to take away is kind

1410
00:50:49,200 --> 00:50:50,950
of the central thesis of the book that

1411
00:50:50,960 --> 00:50:52,830
all work is risk management. It doesn't

1412
00:50:52,840 --> 00:50:54,110
matter what it is, right? If you're a

1413
