theory. Is all the work you're doing

1427
00:51:23,520 --> 00:51:25,270
risk management? Can you view it through

1428
00:51:25,280 --> 00:51:27,710
a risk management lens? And does that

1429
00:51:27,720 --> 00:51:30,710
actually help you decide what to work on

1430
00:51:30,720 --> 00:51:32,710
better? For me, it certainly does. I

1431
